id: golden-oozaru-primal-spark
name: Primal Spark
order: 2
slot: legendary
description: >
  The untamed roar of the Great Ape within, sparking with golden power, has awakened the primal energy deep inside you.
text: >
  Primal Spark: The untamed roar of the Great Ape within, sparking with golden power, has awakened the primal energy deep inside you.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you possess 2+ stacks of Battle Born applied to your Wound Rolls, increase your Surgency by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you use a Surge during your turn, you may enter the Superior State until the end of that turn.
  (3)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Encounter]: If you have 2+ stacks of Battle Born applied to your Wound Rolls, you may use a Ki Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

